# Booster Agent (core idea)

Capturing the current trend hashtags/ QRs/phrases/URLs etc and analyze them and co-relate them on why they are treanding and collect this information to create a cool interactive dashboard that gives us most useful information to all age groups and compititors in the bussiness that will leverage their campains.

- Booster is a first-class product surface, not a side script.
- Capture artifacts from real posts only. Never invent posts or a fake WHY.
- Translate every hot topic for kids / Gen Z / millennials / Gen X / boomers and for campaign competitors (hook, timing, risk).
- Keep `/api/trends` and the D3 map stable. Add booster via `/api/booster` and composed UI.
- After work on this project, suggest 3–5 ranked improvisations that make the dashboard or campaigns smarter.
- Read `docs/presentation/CORE_IDEA.md` and `agents/booster-agent/IMPROVISATIONS.md` before proposing new features.
